{"version":1,"content":"<p>中午12時許，一名內地船員屯門內河碼頭在一艘貨船上，從高處墮下甲板當場昏迷，同事發現立即報警。</p><p>救援人員接報到場將傷者救起。</p><p>51歲姓譚男事主，頭部受傷昏迷，由救護車送往屯門醫院。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.249085+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:05:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T02:18:07.676726+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:40.684168+00:00","content_hash":"7c829b7f13c9e498b3e2fb2e5e3afed3a21d3975f69ce1fd6fd4e7ab966a5449","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}